  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP governance assessmen                         2009-2013 - UNDP governance assessmen</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNDP governance assessmen                         2009-2013</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till UNDP f&#xf6;r genomf&#xf6;rande av ett globalt program f&#xf6;r st&#xe4;rkande  av nationell kapacitet och kunskap f&#xf6;r att leda och genomf&#xf6;ra         bed&#xf6;mningar av demokratisk samh&#xe4;llsstyrning. Aktiviteter p&#xe5; global,   regional och landniv&#xe5;. 16 pilotl&#xe4;nder. Programmet leds av UNDP Olso   Governance Centre. Programmet p&#xe5;g&#xe5;r 2008-2011. Sidast&#xf6;d ges under     2010-2011.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UNDP for implementation of Global Programme on Capacity    Development for Democratic Governance: Assessments and Measurements   2008-2011. Sida support for 2010-2011. The programme aims to          strengthen national capacity to lead and execute governance           assessments. Activities on 3 levels, global, regional and country (16 pilot countries). Implemented by UNDP Oslo Governance Centre.</narrative>
  </description>
